.SH NAME
retrode3-info \- get info about a cart
.SH SYNOPSIS
retrode3-info [USERNAME]
.SH DESCRIPTION
retrode3-info is a testme.
.SH OPTIONS
The retrode3-info does not take any options. However, you can supply username.
.SH SEE ALSO
retrode3-wlan(1) 
.SH BUGS
No known bugs.
